{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector/pulls/16140","id":4807960233,"node_id":"PR_kwDOCxQENc8AAAABHpOmqQ","html_url":"https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector/pull/16140","diff_url":"https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector/pull/16140.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector/pull/16140.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector/issues/16140","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector/pulls/16140/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector/pulls/16140/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector/issues/16140/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector/statuses/859e0aecd4bedd24e3b49e49cae9ff469925404d","number":16140,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[exporterhelper] keep queued items that fail during shutdown","user":{"login":"abhisheksharma2411","id":3395340,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTUzNDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3395340?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheksharma2411","html_url":"https://github.com/abhisheksharma2411","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheksharma2411/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheksharma2411/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheksharma2411/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheksharma2411/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheksharma2411/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheksharma2411/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheksharma2411/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheksharma2411/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheksharma2411/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"#### Description\n\nSo, our saving box (the persistent queue) is supposed to keep your data safe if things crash or restart. But we found a funny bug: if you turned the app off nicely (a clean shutdown), it accidentally threw all your saved data away! But if you yanked the power cord (a hard kill), it saved everything just fine. Weird, right?\n\nThat happened because it was looking at a specific, complicated error type to decide whether to save things or delete them.\n\nInstead of guessing based on the error, I made it look at something it already knows (`pq.stopped`). Now, it knows for sure when we are shutting down and keeps your data safe no matter what.\n\n#### Link to tracking issue\nFixes #15677\n\n#### Testing\n\nI added two new tests in `persistent_queue_shutdown_loss_test.go` to make sure it's bulletproof:\n\nTest 1: If a message fails while we're shutting down, it survives a restart. (This used to fail, but now it passes!)\n\nTest 2: If a message successfully sends right as we're shutting down, it still gets deleted so we don't accidentally send it twice.\n\nEverything in the exporter helper tree passes, and `make chlog-validate` is happy too.\n\n#### Documentation\n\nNo documentation changes needed, but I added a little `.chloggen` entry (bug_fix, pkg/exporterhelper, issue 15677).\n\n#### Authorship\n\n- [x] I, a human, wrote this pull request description myself.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-10T02:15:21Z","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:39:52Z","closed_at":"2026-10-13T18:39:52Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"004a427a51178a3c8b48f7fddbf4f767b2f94eee","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"bogdandrutu","id":1373887,"node_id":"MDQ